## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## rpc and remote shells reach the gateway node on 127.0.0.1:4370 (vm.args) without
## epmd, and never listen themselves
-start_epmd false
-erl_epmd_port 4370
-dist_listen false
